msgid ""
"Allow Tonearm to run in the background by hiding the player window instead "
"of quitting the application"
msgstr ""
"Rakenduse sulgemisel luba Tonearmil peita end esiplaanilt ja jääda taustal "
"tööle"

msgid "Allow Tonearm to send scrobbling data to Last.fm"
msgstr ""
"Luba Tonearmil saata kraasimisandmeid (lugude esitamiste ja meeldimiste "
"andmeid) Last.fm-i teenusele"

